{"suttaId":"tha-ap459","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"Ap-ii","vriCode":"s0510m2.mul","paras":[1196,1231],"vripara":"37"},"segments":{"tha-ap459:0.3":"Ekachattiyattheraapadānaṃ","tha-ap459:1.1":"“Aṅgārajātā pathavī, kukkuḷānugatā mahī;","tha-ap459:1.3":"Padumuttaro bhagavā, abbhokāsamhi caṅkami.","tha-ap459:2.1":"“Paṇḍaraṃ chattamādāya, addhānaṃ paṭipajjahaṃ;","tha-ap459:2.3":"Tattha disvāna sambuddhaṃ, vitti me upapajjatha.","tha-ap459:3.1":"“Marīciyotthaṭā [maricimophunā (syā.), marīcivophuṭā (pī.)] bhūmi, aṅgārāva mahī ayaṃ;","tha-ap459:3.3":"Upahanti [upavāyanti (sī. pī.)] mahāvātā, sarīrassāsukhepanā [sarīrakāyukhepanā (syā.)].","tha-ap459:4.1":"“Sītaṃ uṇhaṃ vihanantaṃ [vihanati (syā. ka.)], vātātapanivāraṇaṃ;","tha-ap459:4.3":"Paṭiggaṇha imaṃ chattaṃ, phassayissāmi [passayissāmi (ka.)] nibbutiṃ.","tha-ap459:5.1":"“Anukampako kāruṇiko, padumuttaro mahāyaso;","tha-ap459:5.3":"Mama saṅkappamaññāya, paṭiggaṇhi tadā jino.","tha-ap459:6.1":"“Tiṃsakappāni devindo, devarajjamakārayiṃ;","tha-ap459:6.3":"Satānaṃ pañcakkhattuñca, cakkavattī ahosahaṃ.","tha-ap459:7.1":"“Padesarajjaṃ vipulaṃ, gaṇanāto asaṅkhiyaṃ;","tha-ap459:7.3":"Anubhomi sakaṃ kammaṃ, pubbe sukatamattano.","tha-ap459:8.1":"“Ayaṃ me pacchimā jāti, carimo vattate bhavo;","tha-ap459:8.3":"Ajjāpi setacchattaṃ me, sabbakālaṃ dharīyati.","tha-ap459:9.1":"“Satasahassito kappe, yaṃ chattamadadiṃ tadā;","tha-ap459:9.3":"Duggatiṃ nābhijānāmi, chattadānassidaṃ phalaṃ.","tha-ap459:10.1":"“Kilesā jhāpitā mayhaṃ … pe … viharāmi anāsavo.","tha-ap459:11.1":"“Svāgataṃ vata me āsi … pe … kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ.","tha-ap459:12.1":"“Paṭisambhidā catasso … pe … kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ”.","tha-ap459:13.1":"Itthaṃ sudaṃ āyasmā ekachattiyo thero imā gāthāyo Abhāsitthāti.","tha-ap459:14.1":"Ekachattiyattherassāpadānaṃ sattamaṃ."},"attha":null,"tika":null}
